[{"id":162827626,"discussion_id":"20cb580f9fd2c1ad578d7dd23a7c3a263d9de026","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| matmul | ✅ [*fanqirui*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui), [*wangzitao_leo*](https://gitcode.com/wangzitao_leo) (2/2) | ✅ [*fanqirui*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-10T19:55:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-12T15:17:42+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162827643,"discussion_id":"75f49849be97bcd07fbc800eec85fe9e15868cf8","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-10T19:55:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T19:55:48+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162827680,"discussion_id":"6e474b1df0b36705ceb30d595fabf630d784c886","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了在A矩阵全载（AFullLoad）模板下，对N方向进行尾块切分时可能引发的计算依赖错误。该问题在M方向存在多行基本块（mBlockCnt > 1）时出现，会破坏A全载模板的计算前提，导致不同计算轮次间的依赖关系错乱，从而产生潜在的计算错误。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`CalcTailBasicBlockAfullLoad`函数中启用尾块切分的条件。在原有条件`adaptiveWin_.tailWinBlockCnt != 0UL`的基础上，增加了`adaptiveWin_.mBlockCnt == 1UL`的限制。此修改确保了仅在M方向仅有一行基本块时，才允许在A全载模板下对N方向进行尾块切分，从而维持了正确的计算依赖关系，保障了计算结果的正确性。","created_at":"2026-02-10T19:56:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T19:56:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162841828,"discussion_id":"ae00da7b3b0d9c97030c8b6d49384fa5682fe21c","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-10T21:31:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T21:31:00+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162841897,"discussion_id":"2e0daf50e23709a8da9c136779dae4e49dc05f56","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-10T21:31:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T21:31:19+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c17d24adff5452d7b741","login":"wuyi_huawei","object_id":"6822c17d24adff5452d7b741","name":"wuyi_51","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wuyi_huawei"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162841977,"discussion_id":"ba21